      "content": "i mean i get that, but i'm super exhausted and honestly just want to sleep it off. i've had this before after long trips and it usually goes away after a good night's rest and lots of water. do you think it's possible it's just some dehydration and sitting still for too long? i'd really rather not deal with an emergency room right now if it's something minor i can just manage at home.",
